<title>SAN MARINO: TENNIS-SAN MARINO MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SAN MARINO MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MARINO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results of the</p>
<p>$300,000 San Marino men's clay court tournament on Monday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Alberto Beresategui (Spain) beat Diego Nargiso (Italy) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Juan Marin (Spain) beat Elia Grossi (Italy) 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>Alberto Martin (Spain) beat Davide Scala (Italy) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy) beat Luis Morejon (Ecuador) 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
